tment areas, hygiene, drainage, workflow, storage, equipment arrangement and installation."},{"title":"5. NAFDAC & Compliance Planning","text":"Registration steps, facility preparation, inspections, documentation, product testing, labels and regulatory planning."},{"title":"6. Risks & Factory Failures","text":"Breakdowns, water quality, staffing, power, distribution, compliance issues and how to reduce avoidable losses."},{"title":"7. Capital & Startup Planning","text":"Understand setup cost categories, business sizes, production capacity and starting small versus scaling up."},{"title":"8. Profitability & Management","text":"Evaluate pricing, costs, distribution, production volume, cash flow, maintenance and reinvestment."},{"title":"9. Opportunities Beyond Factory Ownership","text":"Understand equipment sourcing, customer referrals, installation career paths, distribution and building toward ownership."}],"aboutHeading":"Learn from people who work with water treatment and production machinery","aboutText":"At Harrison Water Solution and Machinery Services, experience in treatment systems, equipment supply and installation informs practical guidance for new and existing producers.","faqs":[{"question":"Do I need to own a water factory to register?","answer":"No. You can learn before investing or explore industry roles that do not require factory ownership."},{"question":"Will I understand NAFDAC requirements?","answer":"The training covers a registration preparation plan and important compliance considerations. Confirm current requirements directly with NAFDAC."},{"question":"Does the training guarantee income or a profitable factory?","answer":"No. Financial outcomes depend on capital, execution, market conditions, quality control and compliance."},{"question":"How do I get dates, fees and registration details?","answer":"Use the registration button to contact Harrison and confirm the current training schedule, format, fees and enrolment requirements."}],"finalHeading":"Learn first. Plan properly. Build with confidence.","finalText":"Whether you are starting, upgrading or exploring an industry opportunity, make your next move with better information.","disclaimer":"Training is educational and does not guarantee business profits, employment, regulatory approval or income.","media":{"images":[],"videos":[],"testimonials":[]},"pixels":{"meta":"","tiktok":"","google":""}}'::jsonb,true),
